republic-function.logic.r2: argue/equivocates: P5 (S16): "lives well" is taken as faring well: prospering, being blessed and happy in P5 and as living (one of the soul's functions) performed well, as its excellence secures where lives_well is used else, a reader says: the argument holds only if they are one; taken apart, C2 (S18) does not follow (republic-function.logic.r2.sense1)
